@prefix n:<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>. @prefix sh:<http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>. @prefix xsd:<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
<urn:test:shape> a sh:NodeShape; sh:targetClass n:ship; sh:property [sh:path n:bridgeWingsEnclosed; sh:datatype xsd:boolean; sh:minCount 1; sh:hasValue true; sh:maxCount 1].
